#: scenario7:scenario7_2F81EBB3_F8A2_41F0_93EE_05BA4326A48B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7fb38f3812d9b4cd6c2e8a21d17a3248eea0070ee0ec0a78968dd27a64868b73
#. default-sha256: 818975fec7105dd17adbda8b8b5a92374b622a87cfde488355a435aba724eb00
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_2F81EBB3_F8A2_41F0_93EE_05BA4326A48B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I would understand if it were clear out...⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫but can you really say it’s "
"“wonderfully” gloomy?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫那个，⟪k:2⟫晴天还可以理解，⟪k:3⟫阴天能这么说吗……？"

#: scenario7:scenario7_DFA0EF82_350D_475B_8014_D38E3E4E9C6F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 593e7c7bafc17da36b8c307276708894d0093f453a3a2c8fcc2dd8125e191ebb
#. default-sha256: 861e092207ce36e34094e1977c30a14c1037a16e91d1a33a9bab23f8593f69ab
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_DFA0EF82_350D_475B_8014_D38E3E4E9C6F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Well, you can’t be outside for very long when it’s not cloudy, so in our case, this is "
"perfect weather."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫因为晴天米歇尔没办法外出啊。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫对我们来说阴天当然是最好的天气。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_E1821575_CA6E_403F_8D30_4330B21534A6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 04be653d2069fb871aa2a0fc4cf0e6bf582f669271100ce444889840980ff608
