#: scenario7:scenario7_C01E4773_3075_4DCE_B133_8C7266956346
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8220f34d569c94c9213e80fbab98df35028b1df611bdb43fc7a45b1d7a3da7ca
#. default-sha256: fe44550c755835bc6afb69057b17f3e1970e3bc767ec05a60961eca15c150006
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_C01E4773_3075_4DCE_B133_8C7266956346"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫What do you say we go for a little stroll, while we can?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Dee’s around today "
"too, so we can see if he’s up for it.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫It’ll be like old times."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫机会难得就去散步吧。⟪k:2⟫今天大哥应该也在家，⟪k:3⟫也叫上他。⟪k:4⟫以前我们经常一起出门"
"吧？"

#: scenario7:scenario7_9406F46A_7FED_421F_A304_80D3F5789C3F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 218f9b931c71b4b76261fa4fd41dd773bde7b37e6277f80ecad14597bc0359c3
#. default-sha256: 0efade7ac11fbf1f7261449d1cb218429f5a9329280ee252ba3e5908dabd58dc
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_9406F46A_7FED_421F_A304_80D3F5789C3F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫We’ve been running around like headless chickens lately,⟪k:2⟫so we haven’t had much of "
"a chance for a sibling outing.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫We’ll have Mom make us a lunch, and then—"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫最近我和大哥都很忙，⟪k:2⟫都没空出门了。⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫我们可以像之前一样让母亲做些便当——"

#: scenario7:scenario7_2086E62F_87B2_47C7_B186_8D57CAE02078
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 40d2c37fa9e2ed72052874e85d87ef9b5c42d3b0d2bd83e8ca042d3e19e4e78e
#. default-sha256: e65f82bfba4cffa024b766a814c372fd05851b51d509c0d13c355129b37c9b20
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_2086E62F_87B2_47C7_B186_8D57CAE02078"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Ooh, we’ll take a couple horses up to the forest’s edge!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫我们骑马到森林去吧！"

#: scenario7:scenario7_AB202D56_42D8_44B8_855B_BA820064EA7D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 97d09ce51d303a20b40f8c7b823f8002dc28434166ac310a722ddaffe9ff0a2d
#. default-sha256: 4b0528eb3bb828b2b6b738be975ac733f9fd3e6dddc584f4b324f1ca10d333bb
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_AB202D56_42D8_44B8_855B_BA820064EA7D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I-⟪k:2⟫I’m fine with that if you are."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫……好、⟪k:2⟫好的。⟪k:3⟫如果哥哥们愿意的话。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_1CC04FBE_D7D3_499E_8D23_9241BEE32370
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3508a32396ef46ff4a4253ac1223eebac60352f73dc38695abbf94c110801aca
#. default-sha256: c37cad249a739e934d0cc1a78e9f63c1cdb83da6d7eb711ef3584e2cb37edb0b
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_1CC04FBE_D7D3_499E_8D23_9241BEE32370"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫You bet your bum I am. I asked, after all!⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Now c’mon, let’s go!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫那还用说，⟪k:2⟫当然愿意。⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫来来，⟪k:5⟫走吧走吧！"

#: scenario7:scenario7_34D266ED_1135_4E45_9C31_EA6D46852228
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6401a8c1a0be2948ad4f26df09ec46e15ce54e421cc3a244c90060bc64d415ac
#. default-sha256: 511b02ea6746d6882630f719fe86f389cf0be5325aeb81c560149722dbc7792b
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_34D266ED_1135_4E45_9C31_EA6D46852228"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫An outing, you say?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫什么？⟪k:8⟫散步？"

#: scenario7:scenario7_54C4A907_7278_42D2_914B_8485A57F286B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0d2b386db91abd5e74de94188fdeb81c37dbeaae116ee204ae923e9f6916bca6
#. default-sha256: 78c6e6a492f4871c14625bb966b063f7cde2ad4c07286a351be682680fa0eaff
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_54C4A907_7278_42D2_914B_8485A57F286B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Yepyep. Hop on a couple horses and head for the forest.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫We haven’t done "
"this in a while, so I figured why not."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫是啊是啊，⟪k:3⟫骑马到森林里去玩玩吧。⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫好久没有大家一起出门了。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_C7FE1404_21B8_4AFB_ACBC_CE0D1EBB2D6E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9386f7ceb7f3f757eb41ae907a7a9976a969eeb213545f4d7b218e88ae3c92f1
#. default-sha256: 6f56d44d8a5080354c44d22f1ba56ec88e5815d1e15b1accb18d0251104aa2c4
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_C7FE1404_21B8_4AFB_ACBC_CE0D1EBB2D6E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I see. Well, if Michelle is coming, I see no reason to say no.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Let’s set off "
"right away."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫是吗，⟪k:2⟫如果米歇尔也一起去，⟪k:3⟫我就没理由拒绝。⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫赶紧走吧。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_0439C8F3_C6DE_422D_BA4F_F3A310E5967F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 329295ad5f576bcb17a9535d702ab2c952862d890cdc9334664312707f2b862b
#. default-sha256: fefdcb481caae4bffb58048c6de1746138c6355e01e753a6bcc7a79664e2a616
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_0439C8F3_C6DE_422D_BA4F_F3A310E5967F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Whoa, whoa, slow down there.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Are you saying you wouldn’t go if it was just me?"
"⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫It’s Michelle or nothing?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫咦，⟪k:2⟫等一下，⟪k:3⟫你的意思是如果米歇尔不去就会拒绝？⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫只有我的话就不去？"

#: scenario7:scenario7_8DF16205_0566_4025_B2D9_528D1AA14340
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7cd2f235fa37b38414673c89190b1068ace66791cb88513c55772eaabfbc0932
#. default-sha256: cc1eda04b0d88803287783de3a7527423ad7aa1e122d5fae13c3feaaecbf8a06
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_8DF16205_0566_4025_B2D9_528D1AA14340"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Of course. Why on earth would I want to go horse-riding alone with you? ⟪k:2⟫I would "
"rather drown myself."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫当然了，⟪k:2⟫为什么我非得和你去散步啊。⟪k:3⟫我绝对拒绝。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_D6BBF839_251E_423D_AD38_1E3477201973
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f7515ade471a85c76ac3ddf84fe2150f85eb35065cdd3b32cbd89b07245fa623
#. default-sha256: 95a6c2c9a4114630ab8f3333767d66e8a8fb01f5523a0bd326115fef9974ab18
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_D6BBF839_251E_423D_AD38_1E3477201973"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫LE GAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAASP!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫哎———————————！"

#: scenario7:scenario7_F4B2BA61_62B5_4150_BFC7_104328D10817
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2ffc97a01999d2393dda1e3e5002f77ac8aec732060853cab4e31cd7573fb33a
